<title>DENMARK: Danish January unemployment rises to 8.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Danish January unemployment rises to 8.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's seasonally adjusted unemployment was 8.3 percent of the workforce in January 1997, up from  a revised 8.2 percent in December 1996, the National Statistics Office said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
